[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7269.91, "timestamp": "02:01:09", "text": "我们先从西边开始搜索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7274.629, "timestamp": "02:01:14", "text": "小偷有一头黑发，穿着……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7278.79, "timestamp": "02:01:18", "text": "我想，是一件蓝色上衣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7283.189, "timestamp": "02:01:23", "text": "哦，瞧。这是经济低迷时期的坏小子先生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7283.669, "timestamp": "02:01:23", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7285.43, "timestamp": "02:01:25", "text": "你好，坏蛋先生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7288.47, "timestamp": "02:01:28", "text": "出去散步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7289.43, "timestamp": "02:01:29", "text": "哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7293.669, "timestamp": "02:01:33", "text": "我不是跟班。我是魔王。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7295.35, "timestamp": "02:01:35", "text": "好的，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7299.99, "timestamp": "02:01:39", "text": "不，绝对不行。它是光明魔王。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7308.95, "timestamp": "02:01:48", "text": "嗯，某种程度上是这样。谢谢。我要去。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7311.27, "timestamp": "02:01:51", "text": "指的是第三个大垃圾箱。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7316.149, "timestamp": "02:01:56", "text": "这里很安静。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7319.669, "timestamp": "02:01:59", "text": "什么？垃圾桶里的东西。只是在做"}]